      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article presents the imaging findings in a patient with sciatica. The reader is invited to identify the labeled anatomical structures and the lesions present. The discussion focuses on the anatomy of the lumbar spine and the relative merits of the various methods of imaging a patient with sciatica."},
